cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or data, please cite the archived release using the metadata in this
  file.
title: 'Code and data for “Restless bandits with imperfect binary feedback: PCL-indexability analysis
  and computation”'
version: 1.0.0
type: software
abstract: Julia code, numerical data, notebooks, validation records, and figures supporting the study
  of restless bandits with binary latent states and imperfect one-sided binary feedback. The package includes
  broad and boundary-focused PCL tests, MP-index computations, policy comparisons, tie-breaking diagnostics,
  and canonical manuscript figures. Mixed licensing is documented in LICENSES.md.
